# Server-side only. Browser-visible values must be prefixed NEXT_PUBLIC_ and declared in
# src/shared/config/env.ts. Never create a real env file in the working tree; never commit one.
API_URL=http://localhost:__SERVER_PORT__
# Optional. The request header a proxy you control sets or appends with the visitor address
# (x-forwarded-for, x-real-ip). Set it in production behind a platform or reverse proxy, or every
# visitor shares one per-address rate limit on the API. Leave it unset when anyone can reach this
# server directly: a client could then choose its own address.
# CLIENT_IP_HEADER=x-forwarded-for
